# Credentials for the health check, in the format libpq expects:
#   hostname:port:database:username:password
#
# A file rather than an environment variable, and that is forced rather than chosen. HAProxy runs
# external-check commands with a sanitised environment - only its own HAPROXY_* variables survive
# - so anything set in compose.yaml simply is not there:
#
#   /usr/local/bin/check-role.sh: line 22: CHECK_PASSWORD: parameter not set
#
# The value is the same published development credential as everywhere else in this cluster, and
# is safe for exactly the same reason: it can only ever be used locally.
*:*:postgres:eventticket:eventticket
